  "body_text": "Aquaculture & Fisheries\nOptimizing the Management and Performance of Aquatic ResourcesGenomic technologies provide new opportunities to improve the management of exploited populations, optimize breeding programs and enhance the sustainability of aquaculture production.LDgenX supports producers, research organizations and fisheries managers in developing innovative genomic solutions for aquaculture and fisheries.\n            Applications\n        \n        Genomic selection\nBroodstock management\nInbreeding monitoring\nImprovement of production traits\nDisease resistance\nFisheries stock management\nProduct traceability\nHealth surveillance\nAquatic microbiome studies\n\n            Related Services\n        \n                 Environmental DNA \n            \n                Population Genomics\n            \n                Sequencing & dPCR      \n            \n                Bioinformatics              \n            \n                Genomic Selection\n            \n            Case Studies\n        \n        Development of custom SNP panels for genomic selection\n    \n        Assessment of genetic diversity in breeding stocks\n    \n        Discovery of genetic markers associated with traits of interest\n    \n        Pathogen monitoring using dPCR\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
  "metadata_path": "source/en/applications__aquaculture-fisheries.json"
